## Membrane Casting

The polymer solution was blade-cast onto the substrate at a controlled pulling speed of **1 mm/s**. Following casting, the membrane coupon was exposed to a **laminar dry nitrogen purge** for **250 seconds** prior to immersion in the coagulation bath. This nitrogen blow was applied to control surface humidity and influence the early-stage phase separation dynamics.

